---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'; import {projects,moreWork} from '../data/projects';
const flagship=projects.find(p=>p.featured)!; const cases=projects.filter(p=>!p.featured);
---
<Base><section class="hero shell"><p class="kicker">Software Engineer · Brazil / Remote</p><h1>I build systems that make <em>complex things</em> usable.</h1><p class="lede">Data-heavy products, SaaS platforms and backend systems — from domain model and architecture to interface, tests and production.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button dark" href="/work">Explore my work <span>↗</span></a><a class="button" href="mailto:palomacordeiro2009@hotmail.com">Work with me</a></div></section><section class="principle shell"><p>I care about the decisions behind a system: <strong>who owns the data, what happens when something fails, how a result can be reproduced, and whether the product is useful to the person on the other side of the screen.</strong></p></section><section class="shell section"><div class="section-head"><p class="kicker">01 / Flagship</p><h2>Selected work</h2></div><a class="flagship" href={'/work/'+flagship.slug}><div><span class="status">{flagship.status}</span><p class="kicker">{flagship.eyebrow}</p><h3>{flagship.name}</h3><p class="big">{flagship.headline}</p><p>{flagship.summary}</p></div><div class="metric"><span>Platform scale</span><strong>{flagship.proof}</strong><small>Collection → storage → API → SDK → analytics → dashboard</small></div></a></section><section class="shell section"><div class="case-grid">{cases.map((p,i)=><a class="case" href={'/work/'+p.slug}><span class="num">0{i+2}</span><p class="kicker">{p.eyebrow}</p><h3>{p.name}</h3><p class="big">{p.headline}</p><p>{p.summary}</p><div class="case-foot"><span>{p.proof}</span><b>View case →</b></div></a>)}</div></section><section class="shell section more"><div class="section-head"><p class="kicker">07 / More work</p><h2>Experiments & client work</h2></div>{moreWork.map(p=><a href={p.href}><strong>{p.name}</strong><span>{p.text}</span><b>↗</b></a>)}</section><section class="cta shell"><p class="kicker">Available for remote freelance & part-time work</p><h2>Have a complicated system that needs to become a useful product?</h2><a class="button light" href="mailto:palomacordeiro2009@hotmail.com">Let's talk ↗</a></section></Base>